data: {"id": "587bab6200aa41e1-thinking-parallel_evidence-799", "run_id": "587bab6200aa41e1", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n**Pod 状态确认**：\n- Pod `aiops-case-v02/workload` 当前状态为 **Pending**，`node: <none>`（未分配到节点）\n- Pod UID: `49f4b3a0-c450-44f9-8baf-ce88e4ed74c4`，生命周期未变化\n\n**FailedScheduling 事件（直接根因）**：\n- 6m19s 和 51s 两次警告事件，原文均为：\n  ```\n  0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory. \n  preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found for incoming pod.\n  ```\n\n**节点状态**：\n- 集群 3 个节点（master、node1、node2）均为 **Ready** 状态，无 Taint/NotReady/Unschedulable 异常\n\n**Prometheus 指标**：\n- `kube_pod_status_phase`", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789109498535, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "587bab6200aa41e1-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "587bab6200aa41e1", "seq": 800, "ts_ms": 1789109505504, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 29.325, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-v02", "name": "workload"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/587bab6200aa41e1-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "e7d0cdb2a6864511e3d4f06be727709e710a286b7f78923cb6f2d5535b488a4d", "bytes": 2569}, "snapshot_sha256": "e0884e3d521c17a80d389bb0a8f893bc89eedb2291a26418c810c4108ddb783f"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: node_start
data: {"id": "587bab6200aa41e1-node_start-conclusion", "run_id": "587bab6200aa41e1", "seq": 801, "ts_ms": 1789109505504, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "587bab6200aa41e1-node_complete-conclusion", "run_id": "587bab6200aa41e1", "seq": 802, "ts_ms": 1789109514274, "node": "conclusion", "node_name": "汇总总结", "duration_seconds": 8.77, "state_snapshot": {"conclusion_length": 1650, "has_errors": false, "has_warnings": false, "conclusion": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v02/workload` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-v02/workload 的容器资源请求 memory 被设置为 1Pi（1 Pebibyte），该值远超集群中所有 3 个 Ready 节点（master, node1, node2）的实际可用内存上限。kube-scheduler 在调度时检测到此资源不可满足，连续触发 FailedScheduling 事件且因无足够内存的 Pod 可抢占（preemption）而失败，导致 Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `Pod aiops-case-v02/workload` 状态为 `Pending` [fact-dd84672abea6] | 确认故障现象 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `memory` 请求量与限制量均为 `1Pi` (1 Pebibyte) [fact-ca91f53c81d3, fact-3dd67f1ea3c1] | 确定异常配置值 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedScheduling`：`0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found` [fact-809d5a09d023, fact-ed90ba8161e6] | 确认调度失败直接原因与抢占情况 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` 值为 `1` (Pending)，无 Unknown 状态 [fact-4026f9d124fc] | 确认 Pod 持续处于 Pending 阶段 |\n\n**证据印证说明**：\nPod 的 `Pending` 状态（#1, #4）与 Kubernetes 调度器发出的 `FailedScheduling` 事件（#3）直接对应。事件详情指出所有 3 个节点均因 `Insufficient memory` 拒绝调度，且无抢占受害者（No preemption victims），这直接由 Pod 配置中高达 `1Pi` 的内存请求（#2）导致。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod aiops-case-v02/workload 配置了 1Pi 的内存请求（#2） → kube-scheduler 无法找到满足该资源需求的节点（#3） → 调度器触发 FailedScheduling 且无可用抢占对象 → Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态（#1, #4）\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 `aiops-case-v02/workload` 的容器资源配置错误。\n具体而言，该 Pod 将 `memory` 的请求（request）和限制（limit）均设置为 `1Pi`（1 Pebibyte），该数值远超集群节点的实际内存容量。Kubernetes 调度器在尝试调度时因无法找到满足 `Insufficient memory` 要求的节点而失败，且由于没有更小的 Pod 可供抢占（preemption），导致该 Pod 无限期处于 `Pending` 状态。证据（#2, #3）充分支持此结论。", "conclusion_formatted": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v02/workload` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-v02/workload 的容器资源请求 memory 被设置为 1Pi（1 Pebibyte），该值远超集群中所有 3 个 Ready 节点（master, node1, node2）的实际可用内存上限。kube-scheduler 在调度时检测到此资源不可满足，连续触发 FailedScheduling 事件且因无足够内存的 Pod 可抢占（preemption）而失败，导致 Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `Pod aiops-case-v02/workload` 状态为 `Pending` [fact-dd84672abea6] | 确认故障现象 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `memory` 请求量与限制量均为 `1Pi` (1 Pebibyte) [fact-ca91f53c81d3, fact-3dd67f1ea3c1] | 确定异常配置值 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedScheduling`：`0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found` [fact-809d5a09d023, fact-ed90ba8161e6] | 确认调度失败直接原因与抢占情况 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` 值为 `1` (Pending)，无 Unknown 状态 [fact-4026f9d124fc] | 确认 Pod 持续处于 Pending 阶段 |\n\n**证据印证说明**：\nPod 的 `Pending` 状态（#1, #4）与 Kubernetes 调度器发出的 `FailedScheduling` 事件（#3）直接对应。事件详情指出所有 3 个节点均因 `Insufficient memory` 拒绝调度，且无抢占受害者（No preemption victims），这直接由 Pod 配置中高达 `1Pi` 的内存请求（#2）导致。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod aiops-case-v02/workload 配置了 1Pi 的内存请求（#2） → kube-scheduler 无法找到满足该资源需求的节点（#3） → 调度器触发 FailedScheduling 且无可用抢占对象 → Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态（#1, #4）\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 `aiops-case-v02/workload` 的容器资源配置错误。\n具体而言，该 Pod 将 `memory` 的请求（request）和限制（limit）均设置为 `1Pi`（1 Pebibyte），该数值远超集群节点的实际内存容量。Kubernetes 调度器在尝试调度时因无法找到满足 `Insufficient memory` 要求的节点而失败，且由于没有更小的 Pod 可供抢占（preemption），导致该 Pod 无限期处于 `Pending` 状态。证据（#2, #3）充分支持此结论。"}, "handoff_summary": ""}

event: final
data: {"id": "587bab6200aa41e1-final", "run_id": "587bab6200aa41e1", "seq": 804, "ts_ms": 1789109514285, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v02/workload` | Pending | Pod aiops-case-v02/workload 的容器资源请求 memory 被设置为 1Pi（1 Pebibyte），该值远超集群中所有 3 个 Ready 节点（master, node1, node2）的实际可用内存上限。kube-scheduler 在调度时检测到此资源不可满足，连续触发 FailedScheduling 事件且因无足够内存的 Pod 可抢占（preemption）而失败，导致 Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `Pod aiops-case-v02/workload` 状态为 `Pending` [fact-dd84672abea6] | 确认故障现象 |\n| 2 | K8s Config | kubernetes | `memory` 请求量与限制量均为 `1Pi` (1 Pebibyte) [fact-ca91f53c81d3, fact-3dd67f1ea3c1] | 确定异常配置值 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedScheduling`：`0/3 nodes are available: 3 Insufficient memory. preemption: 0/3 nodes are available: 3 No preemption victims found` [fact-809d5a09d023, fact-ed90ba8161e6] | 确认调度失败直接原因与抢占情况 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_status_phase` 值为 `1` (Pending)，无 Unknown 状态 [fact-4026f9d124fc] | 确认 Pod 持续处于 Pending 阶段 |\n\n**证据印证说明**：\nPod 的 `Pending` 状态（#1, #4）与 Kubernetes 调度器发出的 `FailedScheduling` 事件（#3）直接对应。事件详情指出所有 3 个节点均因 `Insufficient memory` 拒绝调度，且无抢占受害者（No preemption victims），这直接由 Pod 配置中高达 `1Pi` 的内存请求（#2）导致。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod aiops-case-v02/workload 配置了 1Pi 的内存请求（#2） → kube-scheduler 无法找到满足该资源需求的节点（#3） → 调度器触发 FailedScheduling 且无可用抢占对象 → Pod 持续处于 Pending 状态（#1, #4）\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 `aiops-case-v02/workload` 的容器资源配置错误。\n具体而言，该 Pod 将 `memory` 的请求（request）和限制（limit）均设置为 `1Pi`（1 Pebibyte），该数值远超集群节点的实际内存容量。Kubernetes 调度器在尝试调度时因无法找到满足 `Insufficient memory` 要求的节点而失败，且由于没有更小的 Pod 可供抢占（preemption），导致该 Pod 无限期处于 `Pending` 状态。证据（#2, #3）充分支持此结论。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 53.0s\n├─ 问题定位: 14.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 29.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v02/workload: 29.3s (Evidence 22.4s, RCA 6.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v02/workload**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 52.97, "metrics": {"run_id": "587bab6200aa41e1", "mttr": {"value": "53.0s", "seconds": 52.976699352264404, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 52976.699352264404, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 49551.207304000854, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 5, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 9236.067533493042, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 3080.151081085205}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name"